{{Short description|First group in 1974 FIFA World Cup}}
{{distinguish|1974 FIFA World Cup Group A}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 1 of the [[1974 FIFA World Cup]]''' was contested between 14 and 22 June 1974. This group was played in [[West Berlin]] and [[Hamburg]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/74full.html |title=World Cup 1974 finals |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref> The pool was composed of the tournament host nation [[Germany national football team|West Germany]] (''Pot 1-Western Europe''), with [[East Germany national football team|East Germany]] (''Pot 2-Eastern Europe''), [[Chile national football team|Chile]] (''Pot 3-South America'') and [[Australia men's national soccer team|Australia]] (''Pot 4-Rest of the world'').

